  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bbm]\n[Cm]\n[Cm]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Cm]\n[Ab]\n[Fm]  [Gm7]\n[Ab]  [Bb]\n[Cm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Cm]You were my\n[Bbsus2]first love The\n[Fm]earth moving\n[Cm]under me\n[Fm]Bedroom scent, beau-\n[Bbsus2]ty ardent\n[Cm7]Distant shiver,\n[Bb]heaven sent\n[Cm]I'm the snow on\n[Bbsus2]your lips The\n[Fm]freezing taste, the\n[Cm]silvery sip I'm the\n[Fm]breath on your\n[Bbsus2]hair The\n[Eb]endless nightmare,\n[Bb]devil's lair\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Cm]\n[Ab]\n[Fm]  [Gm7]\n[Ab]  [Bb]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Cm]Only so\n[Bbsus2]many times\n[Fm]I can say I\n[Cm]long for you\n[Fm]The lily among the\n[Bbsus2]thorns\n[Cm7]The prey among the\n[Bb]wolves\n[Cm]Someday, I will\n[Bbsus2]feed a snake\n[Fm]Drink her venom,\n[Cm]stay awake With\n[Fm]time all pain will\n[Bbsus2]fade Through your\n[Eb]memory I will\n[Bb]wade\n\n[Chorus]\n[Fm]Barely cold\n[Cm]in her grave\n[Eb]Barely warm in my\n[Bb]bed\n[Fm]Settling for a\n[Eb]draw tonight\n[Bbm]Puppet girl, your\n[Db]strings are mine\n[Fm]Barely cold\n[Cm]in her grave\n[Eb]Barely warm in my\n[Bb]bed\n[Fm]Settling for a\n[Eb]draw tonight\n[Bbm]Puppet girl, your\n[Db]strings are\n\n[Interlude]\n[Cm]mine\n\n[Bridge]\n[Cm]\n[Bbsus2]\n[Fm]\n[Cm]\n[Fm]\n[Bbsus2]\n[Cm7]\n[Bb]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Cm]This one is\n[Bbsus2]for you for\n[Fm]you Only\n[Cm]for you\n[Fm]Just give in to it\n[Bbsus2]never think a-\n[Eb]gain I feel\n[Bb]for you\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dm]This one is\n[Csus2]for you for\n[Gm]you Only\n[Dm]for you\n[Gm]Just give in to it\n[C]never think a-\n[F]gain I feel\n[C]for you\n[Dm]This one is\n[Csus2]for you for\n[Gm]you Only\n[Dm]for you\n[Gm]Just give in to it\n[C]never think a-\n[F]gain I feel\n[C]for you\n\n[Outro]\n[Dsus4]\n[Dm]",
